We see the same behaviour on an Intel NUC5i7. I haven't looked at the capab=
ilities reported by the TPM device on that platform. The attached patch (se=
tting max_data_size =3D MAX_NV_BUFFER_SIZE when max_data_size is reported a=
s 0), sorts the problem out.


